<newsitem itemid="107720" id="root" date="1996-10-10" xml:lang="en">
<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Premium Properties raises interim unit.</title>
<headline>Premium Properties raises interim unit.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Aug 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Linked unit, distrib (cts)  7.20  vs  5.64</p>
<p>    - interest			7.06  vs  5.53</p>
<p>    - dividend			0.14  vs  0.11</p>
<p>    Income			    0.59  vs  0.12</p>
<p>    Pre-tax			   0.71  vs  0.23</p>
<p>    Tax				 0.11  vs  0.11</p>
<p>    Interest paid		  13.88  vs 13.12</p>
<p>    Turnover			 29.97  vs 26.58</p>
<p>Div/interest payable Nov 11</p>
<p>on register Oct 25</p>
<p>Full name: Premium Properties Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said it anticipated growth for the next financial period based on projected rental income.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
